## Architecture layers

```
domain/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/     # Entities + repository interfaces (pure Python)
use_cases/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/  # Application logic
adapters/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/   # Django app (views, ORM models, repo impl)
```

- **domain/** — Pure Python, no framework dependencies. Entities and repository ABCs.
- **use_cases/** — Application use cases depend only on domain interfaces.
- **adapters/** — Django apps that implement repository interfaces with Django ORM
  and expose DRF views. Registered in `INSTALLED_APPS`.

